      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Losartan (Cozaar) is an angiotensin II receptor blocker (ARB) used to treat high blood pressure, protect kidney function in type 2 diabetes, and lower the risk of stroke.",
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Common Side Effects"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Dizziness or lightheadedness (especially when standing up quickly from a sitting or lying position)"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Fatigue, weakness, or tiredness"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Upper respiratory tract infections or cold-like symptoms"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Back pain or joint/muscle pain"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Diarrhea or mild stomach upset"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Low blood sugar (hypoglycemia) in some patients"
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          2,
          3,
          4,
          5,
          6,
          7,
          8,
          9
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Serious Side Effects & Risks"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "High potassium levels (hyperkalemia): Can cause muscle weakness or irregular heart rhythms; avoid potassium supplements or salt substitutes unless advised by a doctor .",
            "reference_indexes": [
              6,
              10
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Low blood pressure (hypotension): Excessively low blood pressure leading to fainting or severe lightheadedness.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              1,
              11
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Kidney problems: Changes in kidney function or acute kidney injury, particularly if dehydrated or taking certain interacting drugs.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              1,
              10
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Severe allergic reactions (anaphylaxis): Swelling of the face, lips, tongue, or throat, or trouble breathing (requires emergency care).",
            "reference_indexes": [
              2,
              12
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Pregnancy warning (Boxed Warning): Losartan can cause serious injury or death to an unborn baby and must be discontinued immediately if pregnancy is detected."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          13,
          14
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Are you asking because you or someone you know is currently taking losartan, or are you experiencing a specific side effect? I can share tips on managing mild symptoms or what to ask your doctor."
      }
    ],
